PARITY THEOREM: SC merged node <=> ODD tiling count; NS merged node <=> EVEN.
 (NS-merged={A,A^op} => count=2|A| even; SC=single class, ODD # grid-sym tilings.)
BLACK subgraph = EVEN-degree (Eulerian) graph on {NS,mixed}; BLUE subgraph = all-ODD-degree on SC nodes.
 => #SC nodes EVEN (blue handshake). tiling_count = blue_other(odd@SC) + black_other(even) + 2*self.
